      "Forest Resources and Deforestation Impacts: Global forest ecological services: Watershed regulation, carbon sequestration, oxygen production, biodiversity habitats, soil erosion control; Drivers of deforestation: Commercial timber logging, agricultural expansion, cattle ranching, shifting jhum cultivation, mining, and hydroelectric reservoirs; Consequences: Desertification, loss of indigenous habitats, and climate change.",
